    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>With this plugin you will be able to set an expiration date for certain categories assigned to posts and products. This is specially useful if you want to create a \\&#8221;featured\\&#8221; or \\&#8221;new arrivals\\&#8221; section in your WooCommerce cart or in your blog.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the folder gf-edit-entries to the /wp-content/plugins/ directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the ‘Plugins’ menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>That’s it!</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.2 &#8211; 2026-09-10</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Compatibility: Tested up to WordPress 7.1 and WooCommerce 11.1.x</li>\n</ul>\n"
